# Oberkellner (M7, D-106): the boss of Stage 9, "Herr Ober" of Cafe Zauner.
# Fast and dignified, never ridiculous; no real person's likeness. Tailcoat
# d/m (tails at the back), white shirt front w with a black d bow tie,
# pomaded hair d with an i shine, a grand n handlebar moustache, grey
# trousers m/d, shoes l, a white napkin w/i. Prop: a silver tray w/i/m
# with a Melange cup w (O crema dot) and a glass of water h/s.
# Tray-up anims (anstellen, telegraph, dash, zahlen, stun): the tray's top
# line is sprite row 12 = 36 px above the feet = the hitbox top (16x36).
# verschnaufen: the tray is lowered to hip height at his back, nothing is
# above his head: the pomaded head top (row 18) is the top of the 16x30
# hitbox ("open").
# idle: polishing a glass (the tray is on the counter, not in his hand).
# anstellen: tray up, index finger raised, eyebrows up ("Hinten anstellen!").
# telegraph: leaning towards the facing direction, stern brow, steam w rising
#   from the cup, the back foot scraping (an i dust puff).
# dash: a long stride, tails flying, the tray level. zahlen: the notepad out,
#   the pencil scribbling. stun: half-turns (frame 1 is mirrored), the cups
#   wobbling, the bow tie askew, Y sparks. verbeugen: a deep bow (45 degrees),
#   napkin over the arm. servieren: the ending's look reference: the
#   Zaunerstollen carried forward on the tray.
# Steam, dust, sweat and sparks are unoutlined effect pixels.
# Faces right; mirror = auto. Built with a scratch script (layers + automatic
# k outline; the bow rotated RotSprite-style), frozen to text here.
sprite = oberkellner
size   = 32x48
origin = 16,48
hitbox = 8,12,16,36
mirror = auto
anim   = idle         frames=2 ticks=30 loop
anim   = anstellen    frames=1
anim   = telegraph    frames=2 ticks=6 loop
anim   = dash         frames=4 ticks=4 loop
anim   = verschnaufen frames=2 ticks=12 loop
anim   = zahlen       frames=2 ticks=8 loop
anim   = stun         frames=2 ticks=6 loop
anim   = verbeugen    frames=1
anim   = servieren    frames=1
